      <li>You have access to clusters with cluster-admin privileges.</li>
      <li>Topology Aware Lifecycle Manager (TALM) is installed on the Red Hat Advanced Cluster Management (RHACM) hub cluster.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
