      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: policy.open-cluster-management.io/v1\nkind: Policy\nmetadata:\n  name: pause-<mcp_name>\n  namespace: openshift-upgrade-policies\nspec:\n  disabled: false\n  policy-templates:\n    - objectDefinition:\n        apiVersion: policy.open-cluster-management.io/v1\n        evaluationInterval:\n          compliant: never\n        kind: ConfigurationPolicy\n        metadata:\n          name: pause-<mcp_name>\n        spec:\n          object-templates:\n            - complianceType: musthave\n              objectDefinition:\n                apiVersion: machineconfiguration.openshift.io/v1\n                kind: MachineConfigPool\n                metadata:\n                  name: <mcp_name>\n                spec:\n                  paused: true\n          remediationAction: inform\n          severity: low\n  remediationAction: inform"} lang="yaml" />
      <p>where <code>&lt;mcp_name&gt;</code> is the name of the machine config pool to pause, for example <code>mcp-1</code>. This value is used in both the policy name and the <code>MachineConfigPool</code> resource name.</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
